* TuxSpice model cards for common power and small-signal MOSFETs that LTspice's
* standard.mos lacks. Written for TuxSpice as VDMOS cards fitted to datasheet typical
* values: Vto = Vgs(th); half of Rds(on) is the channel at the datasheet gate drive (Kp),
* half is Rd + Rs; Cgs = Ciss - Crss, Cgdmin = Crss / 2, Cgdmax from Qg, Cjo = Coss.
* Approximations, not manufacturer models. Vds, Ron, Qg and mfg are picker metadata,
* as in standard.mos. tests/test_models.py checks Rds(on) and Vgs(th) in ngspice.
.model 2N7000 VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=2.1 Rd=0.48 Rs=0.12 Rb=0.6 Kp=0.211 Cgdmax=4.5e-11 Cgdmin=2e-12 Cgs=1.6e-11 Cjo=1.1e-11 Is=1p tt=20n ksubthres=.1 mfg=OnSemi Vds=60 Ron=1.2e+03m Qg=1.5n)
.model BS250 VDMOS(pchan Rg=2 Vto=-2 Rd=3.6 Rs=0.9 Rb=4.5 Kp=0.0278 Cgdmax=3.6e-11 Cgdmin=2.5e-12 Cgs=2e-11 Cjo=1.5e-11 Is=1p tt=20n ksubthres=.1 mfg=Diodes Vds=-45 Ron=9e+03m Qg=1.2n)
.model AO3400 VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=1.05 Rd=0.0076 Rs=0.0019 Rb=0.0095 Kp=11.8 Cgdmax=1.8e-10 Cgdmin=2.5e-11 Cgs=5.8e-10 Cjo=7.5e-11 Is=1p tt=100n ksubthres=.1 mfg=AOS Vds=30 Ron=19m Qg=6n)
.model IRF520 VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=3 Rd=0.08 Rs=0.02 Rb=0.1 Kp=1.43 Cgdmax=4.8e-10 Cgdmin=1.7e-11 Cgs=3.26e-10 Cjo=1.5e-10 Is=1p tt=100n ksubthres=.1 mfg=Vishay Vds=100 Ron=200m Qg=16n)
.model IRF540 VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=3 Rd=0.024 Rs=0.006 Rb=0.03 Kp=4.76 Cgdmax=2.16e-09 Cgdmin=6e-11 Cgs=1.58e-09 Cjo=5.6e-10 Is=1p tt=100n ksubthres=.1 mfg=Vishay Vds=100 Ron=60m Qg=72n)
